WEBVTT

00:06:29.009 --> 00:06:30.219
is self-sustained,

00:06:30.261 --> 00:06:32.638
but it is a source
of additional renewable energy.

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.348
Quite incredible.

00:06:35.307 --> 00:06:39.728
So we have this amazing product
that is a climate solution,

00:06:39.728 --> 00:06:41.522
an agricultural solution

00:06:41.564 --> 00:06:44.108
and a renewable energy solution.

00:06:44.567 --> 00:06:46.986
And now, you start to wonder:

00:06:47.027 --> 00:06:50.865
"How come this biochar thing
that he's talking about

00:06:50.906 --> 00:06:54.201
is not widely used all over the place?

00:06:54.201 --> 00:06:55.536
What's the problem?"

00:06:56.579 --> 00:06:58.622
Well, the answer is plain and simple:

00:06:58.664 --> 00:06:59.790
costs.